Let $M/L/K$ be a tower of finite extensions of fields. Then
$$
\text{Trace}_{M/K} = \text{Trace}_{L/K} \circ \text{Trace}_{M/L}
\quad\text{and}\quad
\text{Norm}_{M/K} = \text{Norm}_{L/K} \circ \text{Norm}_{M/L}
$$

